# Local developer overrides — personal, never committed.
# The dividing line in this repository: `appsettings*.json` are CONFIGURATION and are versioned,
# including the development placeholders they already carry (local database password, local JWT
# key). Real secrets never live in the repository: in production they arrive as environment
# variables from SSM Parameter Store, and for local work the right home is .NET user-secrets
# (`dotnet user-secrets set`), which stores them in the user profile, outside the working tree.
# Anything you need to override on your own machine goes in one of these files.
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json

